INSTRUMENT OF AUTHORIZATION

AUTHORIZATION FOR OFFICIAL REPRESENTATION ON DISCORD PLATFORM

WHEREAS the International Organization for Identity Documents (hereinafter referred to as "OIDI") maintains official channels of communication through modern digital platforms;

AND WHEREAS inquiries have been received regarding the authenticity of the OIDI's presence on the Discord platform;

NOW THEREFORE I, General Secretary of the International Organization for Identity Documents, acting pursuant to the authority vested in me under the constitutive instrument of the OIDI;

HEREBY AUTHORIZE AND CERTIFY that the Discord account bearing the username (“oidi.int”) is the sole official and authentic representation of the International Organization for Identity Documents on the Discord platform;

The authorized Discord account bearing the username (“oidi.int”) shall be operated by the Legal Counsel of the OIDI and Officials of the General Secretariat, and is empowered to, inter alia:

Communicate official positions, announcements, and information on behalf of the OIDI;
Engage with Member States, observers, international organizations, and other stakeholders;
Provide information regarding treaties, agreements, and instruments deposited with the General Secretary;
Facilitate dialogue and coordination on matters relating to identity documentation standards and international cooperation. 
IT IS HEREBY DECLARED that no other Discord account is authorized to represent the OIDI unless specifically designated by subsequent official instrument. All communications from the account bearing the username (“oidi.int”) shall be considered as emanating from the OIDI and reflecting its official positions;

This authorization shall remain in effect unless modified or revoked by subsequent instrument of the General Secretary.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have executed this Instrument of Authorization on the nineteenth day of November, two thousand twenty-five;

